{
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "strings": {
    "": {
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "%@ recovery phrase.txt": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 找回短语.txt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ — Unlocked": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ — 已解锁"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld": {
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "%lld minutes": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld 分钟"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld/12": {
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "1 hour": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1 小时"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "12 words that unlock the vault if you forget the password.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "忘了密码时，用这 12 个词解锁保险库。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "2 hours": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "2 小时"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A FolderSafe vault is an encrypted folder. While it’s locked, nothing on this Mac can read what’s inside — not AI agents, not other apps, not even admin (root) processes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "FolderSafe 保险库是一个加密文件夹。上锁时，这台 Mac 上谁都读不到里面的内容——AI 智能体、其他 App，连管理员（root）进程也不行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A disk error occurred (%@).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "磁盘出错（%@）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A folder named “%@” already exists there. Choose another name or location.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "那里已有名为“%@”的文件夹。请换个名字或位置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A locked vault is only encrypted data. While a vault is unlocked, any app on this Mac — including AI tools — can read its files, so the shorter it stays open, the better.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上锁的保险库只是一堆加密数据。解锁期间，这台 Mac 上的任何 App（包括 AI 工具）都能读取里面的文件，所以开着的时间越短越好。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A vault is a normal folder that holds only encrypted files. Put it anywhere — on this Mac, an external drive, or a synced folder such as iCloud Drive.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保险库是一个普通文件夹，里面只存加密后的文件。放在哪里都行：这台 Mac、外接硬盘，或 iCloud 云盘这类同步文件夹。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "About": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关于"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "About FolderSafe": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关于 FolderSafe"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add Existing Vault…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加已有保险库…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add Vault": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加保险库"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allow FolderSafe in System Settings › General › Login Items.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请在“系统设置 › 通用 › 登录项”里允许 FolderSafe。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Already added": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已经添加过了"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Also set a new password": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同时设置新密码"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An encrypted folder for the AI era.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AI 时代的加密文件夹。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Any app on this Mac — including AI tools — can read an unencrypted text file, and so can anyone who gets the file. Paper is safer. If you save it, keep it somewhere private (for example, a USB drive you store away) and never inside this vault.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台 Mac 上的任何 App（包括 AI 工具）都能读取未加密的文本文件，拿到这个文件的人也能。写在纸上更安全。如果一定要存，请放在私密的地方（比如收起来的 U 盘），千万不要放进这个保险库里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "As real folders (~/FolderSafe)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "作为真正的文件夹（~/FolderSafe）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "At least 8 characters": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "至少 8 个字符"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Auto-Lock": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自动上锁"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Back": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上一步"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cancel": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "取消"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Change": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "更改"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Change Password": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "更改密码"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Change…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "更改…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "抽查"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check Again": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "再检查一次"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check Your Recovery Phrase": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "核对找回短语"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Checking…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在检查…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose Folder…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择文件夹…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose a Password": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设置密码"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose a vault folder — the folder that contains “vault.cryptomator”. Vaults created with Cryptomator work too.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择保险库文件夹，即包含“vault.cryptomator”的那个文件夹。用 Cryptomator 建的保险库也可以。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose an empty folder": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请选择空文件夹"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose an empty folder where “%@” appears when unlocked.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择一个空文件夹，“%@”解锁后会出现在这里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose the folder that contains “vault.cryptomator”. If you picked a folder inside the vault, go one level up.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请选择包含“vault.cryptomator”的文件夹。如果选到了保险库里面的文件夹，请往上一层。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose where to put the new vault folder.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择新保险库文件夹的存放位置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Click **Open System Settings**.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "点按**打开系统设置**。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Close": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关闭"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Confirm new password": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "确认新密码"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Confirm password": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "确认密码"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Continue": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "继续"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Continue Setup": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "继续设置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Couldn’t add the vault": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法添加保险库"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Couldn’t remove the vault": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法移除保险库"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Couldn’t unlock": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法解锁"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Create New Phrase": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "生成新短语"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Create Vault": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "创建保险库"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Create a New Recovery Phrase": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "生成新的找回短语"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Create a Vault": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "新建保险库"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Create a new vault or add an existing one": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "新建保险库，或添加已有的保险库"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Creating vault…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在创建保险库…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Current password": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当前密码"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Discard Vault": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "放弃这个保险库"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Discard the new vault?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "放弃新建的保险库？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Done": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "完成"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Encrypted folder": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "加密文件夹"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Encrypted on disk. Nothing on this Mac can read these files until you unlock the vault — not AI agents, not other apps, not admin (root) processes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已在磁盘上加密。解锁之前，这台 Mac 上谁都读不到这些文件——AI 智能体、其他 App、管理员（root）进程都不行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enter a name.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请输入名称。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enter the 12-word recovery phrase for “%@”.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "输入“%@”的 12 词找回短语。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enter the password for “%@” to continue.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "输入“%@”的密码以继续。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enter the password for “%@”.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "输入“%@”的密码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enter the vault’s password.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "输入保险库的密码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enter these words from your written copy, to make sure it’s complete and readable.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "照着你抄下的短语填写这几个词，确认抄得完整、看得清。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enter these words from your written copy.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "照着你抄下的短语填写这几个词。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fair": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一般"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Files in that folder would be hidden while the vault is unlocked.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "解锁期间，那个文件夹里原有的文件会被遮住。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "FolderSafe": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "FolderSafe"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "FolderSafe Website": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "FolderSafe 官网"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "FolderSafe also locks all vaults when it quits. Automatic locking closes vaults even if apps still have files open in them, so save your work regularly.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "退出 FolderSafe 时也会把所有保险库上锁。自动上锁时，即使还有 App 打开着里面的文件也会强制关闭，请记得随时保存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "FolderSafe can’t open vaults stored at %@ in Finder. Move the vault folder into your home folder or onto an external drive, add it to FolderSafe again, then unlock.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "FolderSafe 无法在访达中打开存放在 %@ 的保险库。请把保险库文件夹移到你的个人文件夹里或外接磁盘上，重新添加到 FolderSafe，然后解锁。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "FolderSafe can’t reset or recover your password. If you forget it, only the recovery phrase on the next page can get you back in. If you lose both, your files can’t be recovered by anyone — including us.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "FolderSafe 无法重设或找回你的密码。忘了密码，只有下一页的找回短语能帮你打开。两样都丢了，谁都无法恢复你的文件，包括我们。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "FolderSafe couldn’t give its Finder extension access to the vault folder. Remove the vault from FolderSafe, add its folder again, then unlock.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "FolderSafe 无法让它的访达扩展访问保险库文件夹。请把这个保险库从 FolderSafe 中移除，再重新添加它的文件夹，然后解锁。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "FolderSafe couldn’t hand the key to the system (keychain error %lld). The vault is still locked.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "FolderSafe 无法把钥匙交给系统（钥匙串错误 %lld）。保险库仍是锁着的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "FolderSafe couldn’t lock it: %@\n\nClose files from this vault in other apps and try again, or force lock now. Unsaved changes in those apps may be lost.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "FolderSafe 无法上锁：%@\n\n请在其他 App 里关闭这个保险库中的文件后再试，或者现在强制上锁。那些 App 里未保存的修改可能会丢失。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "FolderSafe couldn’t lock “%@” first, so it was not removed. Close any files from the vault and try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "FolderSafe 没能先给“%@”上锁，所以没有移除。请关掉保险库里打开的文件后再试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "FolderSafe doesn’t have permission to access this folder.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "FolderSafe 没有权限访问这个文件夹。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "FolderSafe feedback": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "FolderSafe 反馈"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "FolderSafe keeps the vault’s key in this Mac’s keychain, protected by %@. It works only on this Mac and turns off automatically if the enrolled fingerprints change. Your password still works.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "FolderSafe 会把保险库的钥匙存进这台 Mac 的钥匙串，由%@ 保护。只在这台 Mac 上有效，录入的指纹有变化时会自动失效。密码照样能用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "FolderSafe never sends your password, recovery phrase or keys anywhere.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "FolderSafe 不会把你的密码、找回短语或钥匙发送到任何地方。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "FolderSafe recovery phrase for “%@”": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
