    "That location isn’t a folder.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个位置不是文件夹。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That name can’t be used.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不能使用这个名称。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Touch ID key couldn’t be read (keychain error %lld). Unlock with your password instead.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法读取触控 ID 钥匙（钥匙串错误 %lld）。请改用密码解锁。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The extension is off. Until it’s on, unlocked vaults appear in Finder’s sidebar instead.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "扩展尚未打开。在打开之前，解锁的保险库会出现在访达边栏里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The extension is on. Vaults now open as real folders.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "扩展已打开。保险库现在以真正的文件夹打开。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The folder %@ isn’t empty, so the vault can’t open there. Choose another folder under “Opens at”.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文件夹 %@ 不是空的，保险库无法在那里打开。请在“打开位置”中换一个文件夹。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The key is kept in this Mac’s keychain and works only on this Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "钥匙存在这台 Mac 的钥匙串里，只在这台 Mac 上有效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The name can’t start with a period or contain “/” or “:”.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "名称不能以句点开头，也不能包含“/”或“:”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The old phrase no longer works. Write these 12 words on paper, in order, and keep them somewhere safe.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "旧短语已失效。请把这 12 个词按顺序抄在纸上，放在安全的地方。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The password has been changed. Use the new password from now on.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "密码已更改。从现在起请使用新密码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The password has been reset. Use the new password from now on. Your recovery phrase stays the same.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "密码已重设。从现在起请使用新密码。找回短语不变。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The password must have at least 8 characters and no line breaks.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "密码至少 8 个字符，且不能包含换行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The passwords don’t match.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "两次输入的密码不一致。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The vault couldn’t be opened as a folder: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法以文件夹打开保险库：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The vault folder can’t be found. It may have been moved or renamed, or it’s on a drive that isn’t connected.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "找不到保险库文件夹。它可能被移动或改名了，或者在未连接的磁盘上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The vault folder couldn’t be closed: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法关闭保险库文件夹：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The vault is created and locked.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保险库已创建，目前是锁着的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The vault is in use by: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保险库正被以下 App 使用：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The vault will be locked and removed from this list. Its encrypted folder stays where it is, so you can add it again later. Touch ID for this vault will be turned off.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保险库会先上锁再从列表中移除。加密文件夹原地保留，之后可以再添加回来。这个保险库的触控 ID 会被关闭。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The vault’s key files appear to be damaged or incomplete (for example, still syncing). FolderSafe hasn’t changed anything.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保险库的钥匙文件似乎已损坏或不完整（比如还在同步）。FolderSafe 没有做任何改动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There isn’t enough free space on the disk.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "磁盘空间不足。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These apps have files open:\n%@\n\nSave your work in them first, or force lock now. Unsaved changes in those apps may be lost.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "以下 App 打开着其中的文件：\n%@\n\n请先在这些 App 里保存，或者现在强制上锁。未保存的修改可能会丢失。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This folder isn’t a vault": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个文件夹不是保险库"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This only changes the name shown in FolderSafe. The encrypted folder isn’t renamed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只改 FolderSafe 里显示的名字，加密文件夹本身不会改名。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This recovery phrase doesn’t belong to this vault, or it’s an older phrase that has been replaced.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个找回短语不属于这个保险库，或者是已被替换的旧短语。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This vault has no recovery phrase. Unlock it with its password.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个保险库没有找回短语。请用密码解锁。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This vault is in use": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保险库正在使用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This vault uses a format or option FolderSafe doesn’t support (%@).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个保险库使用了 FolderSafe 不支持的格式或选项（%@）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This vault uses features this version of FolderSafe doesn’t know yet, so it can’t be changed. Please update FolderSafe.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个保险库用到了当前版本 FolderSafe 还不认识的功能，因此不能修改。请更新 FolderSafe。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To open unlocked vaults as real folders, FolderSafe uses a macOS file system extension. macOS asks you to turn it on once.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "为了把解锁的保险库作为真正的文件夹打开，FolderSafe 需要使用 macOS 文件系统扩展。macOS 要求你手动打开一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To open vaults as real folders, turn on the FolderSafe file system extension. Until then, unlocked vaults appear in Finder’s sidebar.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "要以真正的文件夹打开保险库，请打开 FolderSafe 文件系统扩展。在此之前，解锁的保险库会出现在访达边栏里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Too short": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "太短"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Touch ID": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "触控 ID"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Touch ID is no longer set up for this vault (for example, after fingerprints changed). Unlock with your password, then turn Touch ID on again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个保险库的触控 ID 已失效（比如指纹有变动）。请用密码解锁，然后重新打开触控 ID。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Touch ID is on": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已打开触控 ID"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Touch ID isn’t available on this Mac right now.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台 Mac 目前无法使用触控 ID。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Touch ID isn’t available on this Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台 Mac 无法使用触控 ID。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Try Again": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "再试一次"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn On": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn On %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn On the FolderSafe File System": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开 FolderSafe 文件系统"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn on **FolderSafe**, then come back and click **Check Again**.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开 **FolderSafe**，然后回到这里点按**再检查一次**。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn on FolderSafe in Finder": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在访达中启用 FolderSafe"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn on FolderSafe in System Settings › General › Login Items & Extensions › File Providers, then click Try Again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请在“系统设置 › 通用 › 登录项与扩展 › 文件提供程序”里打开 FolderSafe，然后点按“再试一次”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn on FolderSafe in System Settings › General › Login Items & Extensions › File System Extensions, then try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请在“系统设置 › 通用 › 登录项与扩展 › 文件系统扩展”里打开 FolderSafe，然后再试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unlock": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "解锁"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unlock Now": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "立即解锁"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unlock with %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用%@ 解锁"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unlock with Password…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用密码解锁…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unlock with Recovery Phrase": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用找回短语解锁"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unlock with your fingerprint instead of typing the password. The key stays in this Mac’s keychain and works only on this Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用指纹代替输入密码。钥匙存在这台 Mac 的钥匙串里，只在这台 Mac 上有效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unlock “%@”": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "解锁“%@”"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unlocked": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已解锁"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unlocked vaults appear": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "解锁后的保险库显示在"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unlocking": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "解锁方式"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unlocking…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在解锁…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unlock…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "解锁…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use Default (~/FolderSafe)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用默认位置（~/FolderSafe）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use This Folder": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用这个文件夹"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Uses a macOS file system extension so unlocked vaults open as ordinary folders that every app can use. Requires turning the extension on once in System Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用 macOS 文件系统扩展，让解锁的保险库成为所有 App 都能用的普通文件夹。需要在系统设置里打开一次扩展。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Vaults": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保险库"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Vaults use an open, documented format compatible with Cryptomator vault format 8, so your files aren’t tied to this app. FolderSafe is independent and not affiliated with Cryptomator.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保险库使用公开、有文档的格式，兼容 Cryptomator 第 8 版保险库格式，你的文件不会被绑死在这个 App 上。FolderSafe 是独立开发的，与 Cryptomator 没有关联。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Version %@ (%@)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "版本 %@（%@）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Weak": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "弱"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Website": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "官网"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When you close the window, FolderSafe stays in the menu bar so you can lock and unlock quickly and auto-lock keeps working.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关闭窗口后，FolderSafe 留在菜单栏里，方便随时上锁、解锁，自动上锁也照常工作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where the unlocked files appear.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "解锁后文件出现的位置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While a vault is unlocked, apps on this Mac can read its files. FolderSafe locks vaults automatically when your Mac sleeps, the screen locks, or after a period of inactivity — you can change this in Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保险库解锁期间，这台 Mac 上的 App 都能读取里面的文件。Mac 睡眠、锁屏或闲置一段时间后，FolderSafe 会自动上锁——可在设置中更改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While unlocked, apps on this Mac can read the files in this vault.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "解锁期间，这台 Mac 上的 App 都能读取这个保险库里的文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While unlocked, apps on this Mac — including AI tools — can read and change these files. Lock the vault when you’re done.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "解锁期间，这台 Mac 上的 App（包括 AI 工具）都能读取和修改这些文件。用完请上锁。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Word %lld": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "第 %lld 个词"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Working…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在处理…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Works with vaults in Cryptomator vault format 8.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "支持 Cryptomator 第 8 版格式的保险库。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Write Down Your New Recovery Phrase": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "抄下新的找回短语"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Write Down Your Recovery Phrase": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "抄下找回短语"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Write the words on paper, in order, and keep it somewhere safe. Anyone with these words can open the vault. Don’t take a screenshot or store them in this vault. They won’t be shown again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请按顺序把这些词抄在纸上，放在安全的地方。任何人拿到这些词都能打开保险库。不要截图，也不要存进这个保险库。它们不会再次显示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your current recovery phrase will stop working immediately. Do this if your phrase was lost or someone else may have seen it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当前的找回短语会立即失效。短语丢失或可能被别人看到时再这样做。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You’ll use it to unlock “%@”. Use something long that you don’t use anywhere else.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用来解锁“%@”。请用一个较长、别处没用过的密码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iCloud Drive": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iCloud 云盘"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS asks you to allow FolderSafe once before unlocked vaults can appear in Finder. Go to **General › Login Items & Extensions › File Providers** and turn on **FolderSafe**, then click Try Again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "解锁的保险库要出现在访达里，macOS 需要你先允许 FolderSafe 一次。前往**通用 › 登录项与扩展 › 文件提供程序**，打开 **FolderSafe**，然后点按“再试一次”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS couldn’t start FolderSafe’s Finder extension. Make sure only one copy of FolderSafe is installed (in Applications), quit FolderSafe, open it again, then unlock.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 未能启动 FolderSafe 的访达扩展。请确认只装了一份 FolderSafe（在“应用程序”文件夹里），退出 FolderSafe 后重新打开，然后解锁。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS didn’t provide a location for this vault. Please try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 没有为这个保险库提供位置。请再试一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS hasn’t registered the FolderSafe extension yet. Make sure FolderSafe is in your Applications folder, open it once, then check again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 还没登记 FolderSafe 扩展。请确认 FolderSafe 在“应用程序”文件夹里，打开一次后再检查。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "unlock “%@”": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "解锁“%@”"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "© 2026 FolderSafe": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "© 2026 FolderSafe"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” Is Ready": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@”已就绪"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” has been created, but setup isn’t finished. If you discard it, its folder (which has no files of yours yet) is moved to the Trash.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@”已创建，但设置还没完成。放弃的话，它的文件夹（里面还没有你的文件）会被移到废纸篓。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” is already in your list.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@”已在列表中。"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version": "1.0"
}